"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">当世界需要守望者，她应此而来。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">她抽丝剥茧，瓦解重重阴谋，如修剪玫瑰般细腻缜密；</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">她悄无声息，划过层层暗影，似端起茶杯般波澜不惊。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">她所服务的，从来不是某个人，而是期待和希望本身。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"valkyrie\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-valkyrie obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器展示</h2> <ul data-target=\"skill.items\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn-list\"><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"0\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn obc-tmpl__switch-btn--active\">\n      初始外观\n    </li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"1\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn\">\n      满星外观\n    </li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"2\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn\">\n      实机展示\n    </li></ul> <ul data-target=\"skill.items\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-list\"><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"0\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-title\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/11/18/50494840/5768a4d36cb9bcf69f1e417befe2dff3_794586111967171837.png\" alt=\"\"> <span>镰刀</span></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table style=\"border-color:#ffffff;line-height:1;font-size:16px;min-width:25px;border-collapse:collapse;\" class=\"\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\"><colgroup><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/12/03/50494840/1e6a45ebc07d1b83f6cdbeda14c63a1c_3126574167442525456.gif\" href=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"1\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-title\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/11/18/50494840/5768a4d36cb9bcf69f1e417befe2dff3_2621568687573349787.png\" alt=\"\"> <span>镰刀</span></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table style=\"border-color:#ffffff;line-height:1;font-size:16px;min-width:25px;border-collapse:collapse;\" class=\"\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\"><colgroup><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/12/03/50494840/ea565ba073306d7dfec3e3ae4bc37b9f_9169461458154117663.gif\" href=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"2\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-title\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/11/18/50494840/5768a4d36cb9bcf69f1e417befe2dff3_8613241704692954176.png\" alt=\"\"> <span>镰刀</span></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table style=\"border-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1;font-size:16px;min-width:25px;border-collapse:collapse;\" class=\"\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\"><colgroup><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/12/03/50494840/295ba89e1aabfa5bdffea25e5f86ce08_3193520874509705180.gif\" href=\"\" style=\"width:775px;border:none;vertical-align:middle;\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></li></ul> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">丝绒刀锋</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">同调(I&nbsp;/II&nbsp;/III)阶</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">敌人受到来自场上角色造成的全伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\">（</span><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">2.0%/4.0%/6.0%</span>）</strong>（该效果为独立加成）（唯一生效）</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">窈窕谍影装备时，敌人受到来自自身的雷电元素伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\">（</span><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">2.0%/4.0%/6.0%</span>）</strong>（该效果为独立加成）</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">双面淑女</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:0秒]</span></strong>武器主动技能的冷却时间、充能次数、技能效果由装备角色的类型决定，若装备佩戴者具有<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>星影偕行</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(64,64,64,1)&quot;&gt;技能：角色的能力特性之一，拥有此特性的角色可化为影侍&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>特性，则造成的雷电元素伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">10.0%</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">窃窕谍影装备时：</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">●星影攻击命中虚数属性敌人时，其【虚无壳体】受到的伤害将会以<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">70.0%</span></strong>的比例传递给【虚无之种】（效果为生命流失）</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">●QTE或重现·QTE命中敌人时，回复25点<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>魅形</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;机制：角色动能，上限100，离场时清空&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">不灭的守望</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">自身造成的全伤害提高10%。窃窕谍影装备时，自身造成的雷电元素伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">20.0%</span></strong>，全队角色造成的全伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">10.0%</span></strong>，<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>星环盈余</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(64,64,64,1)&quot;&gt;状态：受&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;命运之轮&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(64,64,64,1)&quot;&gt;庇护的角色，在&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;星之环能级&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(64,64,64,1)&quot;&gt;达到最大值后，继续获得&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;星之环能级&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(64,64,64,1)&quot;&gt;时进入该状态，并可获得相关增益&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>状态下额外提升至<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">20.0%</span></strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 3;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取途径</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">补给获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">装备补给</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">大伟哥别墅</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">消耗<a href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1180/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\" data-type=\"obc-content\" target=\"_blank\">大伟哥黑金卡</a>兑换获得</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 4;\"> <div data-part=\"material\" data-tmpl=\"stigmata\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-stigmata obc-tmpl__part--material obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>进化材料</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <thead><tr><th>突破等级</th> <th colspan=\"5\">所需材料</th></tr></thead> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">35</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1132/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">三分结晶</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*3</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1273/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">相转移镜面</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*3</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">40</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1132/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">三分结晶</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*3</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_