re-wrap%3B%20min-height%3A%201.5em%3B%5C%22%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E3%80%90%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E3%80%91%E5%B8%B8%E9%A9%BB%E5%85%A8%E4%BC%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%A9%E6%88%B4%E8%80%85%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E6%98%9F%E5%BD%B1%E5%81%95%E8%A1%8C%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7%E6%97%B6%E9%9B%B7%E4%BC%A4%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E3%80%90%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E7%9B%B8%E6%80%A7%E3%80%91%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22color%3Argba(64%2C64%2C64%2C1)%5C%22%3E%E7%AA%88%E7%AA%95%E8%B0%8D%E5%BD%B1%3C%2Fspan%3E%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%9F%E5%BD%B1%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%AD%E8%99%9A%E6%95%B0%E6%95%8C%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8E%E5%A3%B3%E5%8F%97%E5%88%B0%E4%BC%A4%E5%AE%B3%E4%BC%A0%E9%80%92%E8%87%B3%E6%A0%B8%E7%9A%84%E6%AF%94%E4%BE%8B%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%EF%BC%8C%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22color%3Argba(64%2C64%2C64%2C1)%5C%22%3E%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%3C%2Fspan%3EQTE%E7%9A%84%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E8%BA%AB%E9%9B%B7%E4%BC%A4%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%A8%E9%98%9F%E5%85%A8%E4%BC%A4%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%9F%E7%8E%AF%E7%9B%88%E4%BD%99%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E5%85%A8%E4%BC%A4%E9%A2%9D%E5%A4%96%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1764737811552\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/12/01/50494840/88e7e41fec8f6c50417eda6fa291805a_3334206578694824121.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>窈窕谍影</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"color:rgba(64,64,64,1)\">推荐武器。提高输出、辅助和循环能力。</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【同调技能】提高敌人受到来自场上角色造成的全伤（独立加成、唯一生效）。窈窕谍影装备时为敌人施加来自自身的雷易伤（独立加成）。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【通用性能】常驻全伤，佩戴者具有星影偕行特性时雷伤提高。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【角色相性】<span style=\"color:rgba(64,64,64,1)\">窈窕谍影</span>装备时，星影攻击命中虚数敌人后壳受到伤害传递至核的比例提升，<span style=\"color:rgba(64,64,64,1)\">提升</span>QTE的循环能力，自身雷伤提高，全队全伤提高，星环盈余状态全伤额外提高。</p></div> <!----></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
